 systems; switch yard maintenance; HT/LT line maintenance; lighting and lightning protection systems; township electrical maintenance; and annual overhauling and capital overhauling of electrical systems and equipment. It also provides annual maintenance contract (AMC) for control and instrumentation system of boiler-turbine-generator (BTG), ash handling plant (AHP), coal handling plant (CHP), and off-site areas; CCTV, PA, and battery and fire systems; programmable logic controller (PLC), distributed control system (DCS), steam and water analysis system (SWAS), and other analytical instruments, as well as testing and calibration services. In addition, the company offers AMC for power plants and process industries, including BTG, AHP, BOP, water and air systems, and FOPH and chemical plants; preventive and breakdown maintenance of process equipment; contingency services emergencies; and round-the-clock operation support during start-ups and shutdowns. Further, it provides operation and management of CHP, wagon tippler, and stacker-reclaimer; operation and management of diesel locomotives; signal and telecom maintenance; p-way track maintenance; engineers, technicians, including highly skilled, semi-skilled and unskilled personnel and other manpower supply services; services of retired railway employees; and industrial housekeeping services with mechanized equipment. Additionally, the company handles erection and commissioning of main plants, CHP systems, and facility management systems (FMS). Sai Urja Indo Ventures Limited was incorporated in 2012 and is based in Nagpur, India.","employees":2058,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795530100},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795530099,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Sai Urja Indo Ventures\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"SAI URJA INDO VENTURES Hits Lower Circuit on BSE, 19 Nov","s":"Univest","d":1795462551,"u":"https://news.go